18b Bléssed are you, O dáughter, by Gód Most Hígh;
you are abóve all wómen on éarth,
and bléssed be the Lórd Gód
who has creáted the héavens and the éarth.

19 For your déed of hópe will never depárt
from the héarts of thóse
who always remémber the pówer of Gód.

Glóry to the Fáther, and to the Són,
and to the Hóly Spírit:
as it wás in the begínning, is nów,
and will be for éver. Amén.
